<title>CANADA: Canadian 88 to be added to Toronto index.</title>
<headline>Canadian 88 to be added to Toronto index.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian 88 Energy Corp said on Thursday its shares would be included in the Toronto Stock Exchange 300 Composite Index on September 27.</p>
<p>Canadian 88 said its shares would also be included in the TSE Oil and Gas Index and the Oil and Gas Producers Sub-Index.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
